    "title": "Student Assaulted by Armed Intruders at Germantown High School as Memphis-Shelby County Schools Bolster Security - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Elena Nguyen ,\n9 hours ago A disturbing scene unfolded at Germantown High School yesterday as reports surfaced of a student being viciously assaulted by two armed individuals, confirmed by district officials. Action News 5 obtained a cellphone video that captures the moment the student, initially off-campus, was chased back onto school grounds and subsequently kicked and pistol-whipped outside the campus cafeteria, prompting screams and cries from onlooking students. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 4",
